&lt;h2&gt;


  Input field value :
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;1.What happens if you use a normal variable?&lt;br&gt;
✓ Without &lt;code&gt;useState&lt;/code&gt; the component won't re-render to show the updated text.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;2.What kind of state works best?&lt;br&gt;
✓ If you use a normal variable, the value might update in memory, but the UI will not reflect the change because React doesn't know it needs to re-render.&lt;/p&gt;

